  SSC3-J4: the compare-and-branch fusion, with the DECISION hoisted to the loop entry —
  which is what turned it from a measured pessimization into arith-loop 20 of 20 at 0.770.

  Paths and why each: Exec.scala (fusablePairs / execFused / the Loop wiring), Main.scala
  (the --no-fuse-cmpbr OFF arm), jit-gate.sh (the ninth identity arm), bench-ab.sh (ON_ARGS,
  because the harness hardcoded the ON arm as the default build), plus the board, the spec
  and the append-only bench history.

  NOTE TO SELF: this list is the WHOLE scope, not an addition — `coord-update --paths`
  replaces, and widening for bench-ab.sh silently dropped jit-gate.sh and Main.scala until
  the pre-commit guard refused the commit.
